        { "visual": "Durante y al final: As you can see on the slide... (Como pueden ver en la diapositiva...). In conclusion... (En conclusión...). Are there any questions? (¿Hay alguna pregunta?).", "audio": "During and at the end: As you can see on the slide. In conclusion. Are there any questions?" }
